-+## Core percentage contract
- 
- ```text
--live ratio = current HP / maximum HP
--corrected current HP = live ratio * new maximum HP
-+preserved ratio = coherent current HP / coherent maximum HP
-+corrected current HP = preserved ratio * stabilized new maximum HP
- ```
